  "description": "The proposal seeks permission to amend the roof design of the existing rear dormer by replacing the existing flat roof with a pitched roof and gable. Additionally, seeking to raise the existing windows within the dormer to allow better internal function of the associated bedroom which it serves.\n\nAdditionally the second element of the proposal seeks to replace existing painted timber the garage doors to the front principal gable. The design being such whereby the replacement doors are matching the existing in size, colour, material and format – albeit with the addition of glazed upper panels (obscured). We are acutely aware of the visibility of the doors from the street scene and as such, have fully considered the aesthetic of the proposal accordingly.",
